// Survival justice scenario for Worldwake.
//
// Purpose: keep the survival loop alive while activating the first truthful
// justice stack under survival pressure. `Merchant Sera` must first secure the
// vacant `Market Warden` office, then respond to `Thief Rana` stealing staged
// market stock through the live local chain: witnessed theft -> missing-lot
// investigation -> accusation -> punishment. In the same survival scenario,
// `Searcher Ivo` owns an overdue local expectation for `Missing Pru`, performs
// a lawful `search_place`, and reports the found status into the local office
// register.
//
// Lawful competing affordances intentionally constrained:
// - no place concealment, patrol, pursuit, combat, trade purchase, or remote
//   travel branches
// - one local office, one office register, and one crime register at the same
//   place
// - food for the tracked agents comes from carried stock or the theft branch,
//   not from harvestable fallback sources
